'''Crazed Bird Cat''' (狂乱のネコノトリ, ''Kyōran no Neko Notori'', '''Frenzy Bird Cat''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that first appears in [[Flappy Cat (Insane)|Flappy Cat]], where it can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

